/* Control Room — The Quiz's question banks.
   Three banks, each in categories: The Workbench (how to do it), The Machine Room (how the gear works),
   The Studio Vault (the stories). Keep a new question in the bank and category whose subject it is.
   Each question: [question, indexOfCorrectAnswer, [A, B, C, D], optional topic tag].
   Questions that share a topic tag (or a right answer) never appear in the same game.
   Answers are shuffled for every game, so the order here does not matter. */
