["What workflow did the Akai MPC60 (1988) give beat-makers?",0,["Sampling, velocity pads and a hands-on sequencer in one self-contained box — no computer needed","Downloading samples over the internet","Touchscreen mixing","24 tracks on cassette"],"mpc"]
