["Who played the piano on David Bowie's \"Life on Mars?\" (1971)?",0,["Rick Wakeman","Elton John","Mike Garson","Nicky Hopkins"]],
["On The Beatles' \"Taxman\" (1966), who played the stinging guitar solo?",2,["George Harrison","John Lennon","Paul McCartney","Eric Clapton"]],
["Which gospel choir sings on Michael Jackson's \"Man in the Mirror\"?",0,["The Andraé Crouch Choir","The Mormon Tabernacle Choir","The Harlem Boys Choir","The Edwin Hawkins Singers"]],
["Which legendary studio album, released in 1977, took over a year to record, used massive multi-tracking, and nearly bankrupted its band due to endless overdubs?",1,["The Beatles – Abbey Road","Fleetwood Mac – Rumours","Steely Dan – Aja","Pink Floyd – Dark Side of the Moon"],"rumours"]
